        "original_id": "a5a83847-64f2-5caf-a2ec-01ccb8ae48fe",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gary Payton, Shawn Kemp, Barry Ackerley\n- Organizations: Seattle SuperSonics, Naismith Basketball Hall of Fame\n- Roles: point guard, owner\n- Events: 1994 NBA All-Star Game, 1996 NBA All-Star Game\n- Awards: Defensive Player of the Year\n\nFacts:\n- Barry Ackerley was the owner of the Seattle SuperSonics basketball franchise from 1983 to 2001.\n- Gary Payton started at the point guard position.\n- Gary Payton made his first All-Star appearance when he was selected for the 1994 NBA All-Star Game alongside Shawn Kemp.\n- Gary Payton and Shawn Kemp were both selected for the 1996 NBA All-Star Game, and Gary Payton was the Defensive Player of the Year.\n- Gary Payton was inducted into the Naismith Basketball Hall of Fame on September 8, 2013.",
